WEBVTT

01:35.030 --> 01:38.670
What are you trying to make me 
do using this thing?

01:38.670 --> 01:40.070
Is there even a point to this?

01:40.070 --> 01:41.390
Of course there is.

01:41.390 --> 01:43.770
That's a necessity.

01:44.550 --> 01:46.510
Well, then, Akutsu...

01:46.510 --> 01:49.380
Now that you've become my servant...

01:49.720 --> 01:52.380
You're going to help me hunt demons.

01:53.470 --> 01:56.280
You're telling me to kill my own kind?

01:56.280 --> 01:57.050
Do you refuse?

01:57.050 --> 01:58.250
Of course I do!

02:00.880 --> 02:02.700
That's surprising.

02:02.700 --> 02:06.520
I didn't think demons had any sense of kinship.

02:06.520 --> 02:09.520
We demons have our own social norms!

02:10.070 --> 02:12.700
How could we betray people 
who've had our backs?

02:13.200 --> 02:16.120
I made too much kinpira.

02:16.120 --> 02:18.200
Thank you again.

02:18.200 --> 02:19.420
Ack, split ends.

02:19.420 --> 02:21.070
Look at me!

02:21.070 --> 02:23.950
I'll have no part of that kind of betrayal.

02:23.950 --> 02:25.930
Exorcise me if you have to!

02:26.560 --> 02:28.010
Huh?

02:28.010 --> 02:29.030
Damn it...

02:30.580 --> 02:31.530
Damn it!

02:31.530 --> 02:34.340
What?

02:32.380 --> 02:35.470
Oh, I forgot to tell you.

02:35.470 --> 02:38.340
I'm the only one who can remove that.

02:38.870 --> 02:41.930
It suppresses a demon's strength.

02:41.930 --> 02:46.540
It even acts as a beacon, 
in case you try to escape.

02:46.540 --> 02:48.520
N-No...

02:49.100 --> 02:51.700
And with a touch of my power...

02:56.180 --> 02:58.540
My body's moving on its own!

03:00.620 --> 03:03.610
...I can punish you.

03:03.610 --> 03:06.870
The only problem is that 
I don't know what'll happen.

03:07.420 --> 03:14.010
If you refuse to cooperate, 
this is my only option.

03:14.010 --> 03:17.100
Well? Will you reconsider?

03:17.100 --> 03:18.680
Wh-Why would I ever...

03:18.680 --> 03:19.580
<i>Shit!</i>

03:19.580 --> 03:21.260
<i>What's happening to me?</i>

03:21.960 --> 03:23.360
Th-Tha...

03:23.360 --> 03:25.020
<i>It's making me talk!</i>

03:26.600 --> 03:29.380
Thank you for waiting, miss.

03:29.680 --> 03:32.200
I am at your disposal.

03:32.200 --> 03:33.280
<i>Damn it!</i>

03:33.280 --> 03:35.860
<i>My body won't do as I say!</i>

03:35.860 --> 03:36.540
Bow.

03:36.540 --> 03:38.270
<i>Why the hell am I bowing?!</i>

03:38.270 --> 03:40.110
Indeed. Let's see...

03:40.760 --> 03:42.390
I'm thirsty.

03:43.940 --> 03:45.820
What's up with the pose?

03:49.220 --> 03:50.970
Thank you for waiting.

03:53.800 --> 03:55.450
I brought a selection, ma'am.

03:55.450 --> 03:57.310
<i>Stop being an errand boy, me!</i>

03:58.000 --> 04:00.300
You aren't holding anything.

04:00.300 --> 04:02.430
My apologies.

04:02.430 --> 04:05.220
I didn't have a bag on me.

04:06.590 --> 04:10.590
These are the drinks you requested.

04:10.590 --> 04:12.650
I've warmed them up with my body heat.

04:12.650 --> 04:14.230
<i>Why would I even do that?!</i>

04:18.580 --> 04:19.980
It's lukewarm!

04:21.240 --> 04:26.200
Made by Akutsu

04:23.680 --> 04:25.740
I'd hate not to do anything 
in return after all this.

04:25.740 --> 04:28.010
Do you not have any requests?

04:27.780 --> 04:31.000
<b>She's rather humble</b>

04:29.200 --> 04:31.070
Requests, you say?

04:31.070 --> 04:33.530
In that case, if I must say...

04:33.530 --> 04:34.870
<i>Now what?</i>

04:35.510 --> 04:38.540
My body is quite stiff as of late.

04:38.540 --> 04:40.420
Especially worrisome...

04:40.420 --> 04:43.340
Are my buttocks, which are in grave condition.

04:43.340 --> 04:46.340
<i>It's my head that's in grave condition!</i>

04:46.340 --> 04:47.660
Oh?

04:47.660 --> 04:49.870
You're asking me to massage your ass?

04:49.870 --> 04:51.210
No...

04:51.210 --> 04:56.650
A mere trampling with 
your fine feet would suffice.

05:00.050 --> 05:01.720
You have strange taste,

05:01.720 --> 05:03.290
as one might expect of a demon.

05:03.910 --> 05:05.450
Very well.

05:05.450 --> 05:07.780
I shall give them...

05:06.560 --> 05:08.790
<i>Stop it... Stop it...</i>

05:08.370 --> 05:10.030
A good trampling.

05:10.030 --> 05:11.580
<i>Please, no!</i>

05:11.960 --> 05:14.000
<i>My butt's gonna get torn apart!</i>

05:14.420 --> 05:15.870
<i>I-Is it all right?</i>

05:15.870 --> 05:17.960
<i>Is it really all right for me to do this?</i>

05:18.330 --> 05:24.450
<i>Am I about to make a huge mistake 
that I can't take back?</i>

05:24.450 --> 05:25.420
<i>No.</i>

05:25.710 --> 05:27.210
<i>It's a reward.</i>

05:27.210 --> 05:28.840
<i>It's his wish.</i>

05:28.840 --> 05:29.870
<i>It's just this once.</i>

05:29.870 --> 05:31.370
<i>It's not a big deal.</i>

05:31.370 --> 05:32.680
<i>Wait, hold on.</i>

05:32.680 --> 05:34.930
<i>Is it really going to end here?</i>

05:34.930 --> 05:36.190
<i>Yeah...</i>

05:36.190 --> 05:37.420
<i>It's just the tip.</i>

05:37.420 --> 05:39.080
<i>Just the tip of my shoe!</i>

05:39.080 --> 05:41.510
<i>I won't take it any further!</i>

05:44.680 --> 05:46.840
Are those two children playing—

05:47.320 --> 05:50.200
—in public?! Lemme join!

05:49.120 --> 05:50.560
This is bad!

05:50.560 --> 05:52.450
She's so fast!

05:53.730 --> 05:55.320
I can move again!

05:55.320 --> 05:56.620
Hold it!

05:57.350 --> 05:59.080
Damn couples!

06:03.480 --> 06:05.310
We lost him.

06:05.310 --> 06:06.720
Yeah.

06:06.720 --> 06:09.210
Now, getting back to it...

06:09.210 --> 06:10.140
What do you say?

06:10.140 --> 06:12.640
Will you cooperate with my work?

06:14.800 --> 06:16.640
I see. You refuse.

06:17.050 --> 06:20.020
You'd be lucky to only to be 
on your fours next time.

06:20.020 --> 06:22.980
You may not even be dressed next time.

06:23.830 --> 06:26.380
So just exorcise me!

06:26.380 --> 06:27.720
I won't do that.

06:27.720 --> 06:29.070
Not yet, at least.

06:29.070 --> 06:29.950
Why not?

06:31.120 --> 06:33.600
I have a goal.

06:33.600 --> 06:35.100
I can't tell you more.

06:35.680 --> 06:39.420
That said, I can't have you 
getting too comfortable, either.

06:42.240 --> 06:43.920
Well, what's your answer?

06:43.920 --> 06:46.020
Will you do as I ask?

06:46.590 --> 06:49.370
Or would you rather commit social suicide?

06:50.630 --> 06:53.140
<i>Such nasty words coming from such a cute face.</i>

06:53.640 --> 06:55.370
Well, uh, well...

06:55.370 --> 06:58.380
How about I tell you if there are 
any demons nearby?

06:58.380 --> 07:01.210
We can kinda tell when 
any of our own are close.

07:02.390 --> 07:03.650
Very well, then.

07:04.030 --> 07:06.840
But if you ever fail to inform me...

07:06.840 --> 07:08.490
I get it! I get it!

07:08.830 --> 07:10.380
Well, it's settled!

07:10.380 --> 07:12.110
<i>I'm sorry, fellow demons...</i>

07:12.110 --> 07:14.040
<i>Please don't come to the human realm anymore.</i>

07:14.490 --> 07:16.140
Akutsu Masatora.

07:16.140 --> 07:19.740
You are henceforth my servant.

07:19.740 --> 07:21.880
Not without recompense, however.

07:21.880 --> 07:27.150
I shall reform you into an honest, true, 
righteous man while you serve me.

07:27.150 --> 07:29.290
That is what you get out of this.

07:29.290 --> 07:30.680
Your reward.

07:30.680 --> 07:32.560
That's a reward?

07:32.560 --> 07:34.140
What? Do you have a problem?

07:34.140 --> 07:37.000
It's not that motivating.

07:37.000 --> 07:39.520
I suppose that's true.

07:39.960 --> 07:41.310
Motivation...

07:41.310 --> 07:43.200
For a man coming of age...

07:43.200 --> 07:44.820
How about this, then?

07:46.640 --> 07:51.540
For every job well done, 
I shall give you one hug.

07:51.540 --> 07:53.160
Want to give it a try?

07:55.030 --> 07:56.780
How could you?!

07:56.780 --> 07:58.040
I'm kidding!

07:58.040 --> 08:00.520
Why would you take that seriously? You pervert.

08:01.000 --> 08:04.220
Anyway, we can think about your reward later.

08:04.220 --> 08:05.000
I found you.

08:06.550 --> 08:09.260
You public ****ing couple!

08:09.260 --> 08:11.340
Come with me, and do not resist!

08:11.340 --> 08:12.870
Let's scram.

08:14.710 --> 08:15.500
Hey, wait!

08:16.100 --> 08:17.260
Hold it!

08:17.260 --> 08:19.420
Stupid! At least be a proper decoy!

08:19.420 --> 08:22.540
I don't remember that being 
the way you talk! Amane-san!

08:27.230 --> 08:29.320
I'm beat.

08:29.320 --> 08:31.480
That was a horrible first day.

08:31.480 --> 08:32.820
Damn angel.

08:32.820 --> 08:35.960
If it weren't for this thing... This collar.

08:36.320 --> 08:37.140
Huh?

08:37.660 --> 08:40.010
The collar's gone.

08:40.010 --> 08:41.620
What's going on here?

08:41.620 --> 08:42.830
Did it fall off?

08:42.830 --> 08:44.700
No, that's impossible.

08:46.020 --> 08:47.150
<i>Hey, yo, Akutsu!</i>

08:47.150 --> 08:48.680
<i>The name's Lily Amane!</i>

08:48.290 --> 08:51.300
Hey, yo, Akutsu!
The name's Lily Amane!

08:48.680 --> 08:50.430
<i>My lyrics ring through my loud soul, yo!</i>

08:49.290 --> 08:51.300
My lyrics ring through my loud soul, yo!
Anyone bald is part of my posse!

08:50.430 --> 08:52.000
<i>Anyone bald is part of my posse!</i>

08:51.550 --> 08:55.090
It's time to get going already!
Your collar's gone but it's part of your body!

08:51.550 --> 08:55.090
My thoughts are with you, baby!

08:52.000 --> 08:53.560
<i>It's time to get going already!</i>

08:53.560 --> 08:55.090
<i>Your collar's gone but it's part of your body!</i>

08:55.090 --> 08:56.230
Annoying...

08:55.520 --> 08:57.100
<i>My thoughts are with you, baby!</i>

08:56.230 --> 08:58.540
And how does she even know my address?

08:57.100 --> 08:59.150
<i>It's a permanent tattoo, your death penalty!</i>

08:59.150 --> 09:00.060
<i>I snuck a look.</i>

08:59.810 --> 09:03.560
I snuck a look.
Took a picture.

09:00.060 --> 09:00.970
<i>Took a picture.</i>

09:00.970 --> 09:01.800
<i>So now you know.</i>

09:01.350 --> 09:03.560
So now you know.
Use this for emergencies.

09:01.800 --> 09:03.560
<i>Use this for emergencies.</i>

09:03.560 --> 09:05.210
She read my mind?!

09:05.210 --> 09:06.780
I hate this!

09:07.590 --> 09:08.780
Hang on...

09:08.780 --> 09:10.090
It's a permanent tattoo?

09:10.090 --> 09:12.700
I can't go to the pool, then!

09:12.700 --> 09:15.070
Come on! I was so hyped about going!

09:15.070 --> 09:17.820
And I wanted to check out 
the super sento baths, too!

09:18.500 --> 09:20.030
Damn.

09:20.030 --> 09:22.280
Oh, Akutsu-kun, you...

09:22.280 --> 09:23.260
Begone.

09:22.450 --> 09:24.160
Begone.

09:23.260 --> 09:27.350
I need to deal with her before she 
causes damage to Hell.

09:28.450 --> 09:29.340
Yes.

09:29.340 --> 09:32.900
All I encountered today was 
one beast-type demon.

09:33.720 --> 09:35.710
Yes, it's been exorcised.

09:36.360 --> 09:37.370
Yes.

09:37.370 --> 09:39.290
I'll continue to be vigilant.

09:44.280 --> 09:47.240
This town's only ever seen 
small fry until now...

09:47.240 --> 09:49.530
And I've finally found a worthy one.

09:49.530 --> 09:52.670
I'm not exorcising him so quickly.

09:52.670 --> 09:55.840
They're going to see me 
manipulate one of his power...

09:55.840 --> 10:00.450
The whole of Heaven will see me!

10:00.450 --> 10:04.620
And they'll regret the way they've treated me.

10:04.620 --> 10:07.460
To that end, I'll make sure...

10:08.160 --> 10:09.880
That she falls!

10:08.160 --> 10:09.880
That he falls!

10:13.940 --> 10:15.510
Pardon me.

10:16.020 --> 10:17.360
Well met.

10:17.360 --> 10:20.930
We don't have much time, 
so let's get to business.

10:21.730 --> 10:22.760
Yes.

10:22.760 --> 10:27.680
Akutsu Masatora, I am transferring 
you to the human realm.

10:27.680 --> 10:30.240
The human realm?

10:30.240 --> 10:35.000
As you're aware, 
Hell is under attack from Heaven.

10:35.000 --> 10:40.570
Alas, rather than responding to the threat,
we are becoming even lazier.

10:40.890 --> 10:43.530
What a grievous situation.

10:44.000 --> 10:45.040
Uh-huh...

10:45.040 --> 10:51.230
That is why I want you to go to the human 
realm and find someone charismatic.

10:51.230 --> 10:54.600
We'll venerate them to raise morale.

10:54.600 --> 10:55.860
What do you think?

10:55.860 --> 10:57.070
R-Right.

10:57.070 --> 10:57.840
Very well.

10:57.840 --> 10:58.920
Please have a look at this.

11:00.160 --> 11:02.170
A photo?

11:02.170 --> 11:06.330
These are photos uploaded 
to the angels' social media.

11:06.920 --> 11:07.950
How could this be?!

11:07.950 --> 11:08.700
Indeed.

11:08.700 --> 11:12.350
The one on the right is an angel, 
and on the left is a demon.

11:12.350 --> 11:13.900
This is awful!

11:13.900 --> 11:17.610
The angels all despise demons.

11:17.610 --> 11:21.740
And terrifyingly, they come to 
hunt us down, as though it were a game.

11:22.180 --> 11:24.320
They forced this one to buy drinks,

11:24.320 --> 11:26.730
then rejected what he'd brought.

11:26.730 --> 11:30.900
They forced this one to reveal 
his suspicious browser history!

11:32.370 --> 11:35.230
My heart aches!

11:35.230 --> 11:39.260
The angels have already sent many 
of their henchmen into the human realm.

11:39.260 --> 11:42.760
They will surely be a formidable foe for you.

11:42.760 --> 11:46.600
However, if we yield now, 
we will have no future!

11:47.140 --> 11:51.600
You are our hope... Hell's hope!

11:52.000 --> 11:57.480
Avoid being slain by the angels, and 
offer yourself to the people of Hell!

11:57.480 --> 12:01.240
Now, stand, our young hero!

12:03.990 --> 12:05.210
Yes!

12:05.210 --> 12:06.410
Good.

12:06.410 --> 12:09.080
Now, receive my gift.

12:12.180 --> 12:13.240
What is this?

12:13.240 --> 12:14.460
A prosthetic scalp.

12:14.810 --> 12:18.750
Wear it to win the humans' 
sympathy and trust.

12:21.720 --> 12:23.220
<i>Those were my instructions...</i>

12:23.790 --> 12:25.890
<i>And I messed up.</i>

12:27.160 --> 12:29.310
<i>Was there even a point to that?</i>

12:31.300 --> 12:33.760
<i>I feel defeated every time 
I look in the mirror.</i>

12:33.760 --> 12:36.190
<i>I just need to hold on a bit longer.</i>

12:36.190 --> 12:38.190
<i>Once I take her down, it's over.</i>

12:36.190 --> 12:39.110
<b>Lovey-dovey Married Couple</b>

12:38.190 --> 12:40.250
<i>How we got close?</i>

12:40.250 --> 12:42.170
<i>Yes. Tell us how you asked him out!</i>

12:42.170 --> 12:45.410
<i>Oh, please, that's embarrassing!</i>

12:45.410 --> 12:47.070
<i>Well, the first time...</i>

12:47.070 --> 12:48.950
Th-That's it!

12:50.980 --> 12:52.220
Hey!

12:52.220 --> 12:53.030
Morning.

12:53.990 --> 12:55.290
What the?

12:55.290 --> 12:56.920
That was a strong wind.

12:56.920 --> 12:58.440
Indoors, too.

13:00.290 --> 13:01.370
Look!

13:03.550 --> 13:05.090
<b>Breezy</b>

13:04.070 --> 13:05.800
Yo. Morning.

13:05.800 --> 13:07.180
Who?!

13:05.800 --> 13:07.180
<b>Who?!</b>

13:07.560 --> 13:09.390
A-Akkun?

13:09.390 --> 13:10.940
That's right.

13:10.940 --> 13:12.830
You seem kinda different.

13:12.830 --> 13:13.760
Nah.

13:13.760 --> 13:16.890
I just changed up my drip.

13:18.130 --> 13:20.360
That's such a lie!

13:20.360 --> 13:22.860
Your jaw's pointier than yesterday.

13:22.860 --> 13:24.620
It's kinda creepy.

13:25.640 --> 13:27.210
Yeah?

13:27.720 --> 13:28.940
Morning.

13:28.940 --> 13:30.540
Lily-chan!

13:30.540 --> 13:32.340
Akkun's just...

13:32.340 --> 13:33.390
Huh?

13:33.390 --> 13:36.370
Amane-san, you look different from usual.

13:37.190 --> 13:39.330
Do I?

13:39.960 --> 13:41.240
<i>Here she is.</i>

13:41.240 --> 13:44.380
<i>I got the idea for this plan 
from the TV show last night.</i>

13:45.470 --> 13:58.020
<b>Lovey-dovey Married Couple</b>

13:45.490 --> 13:47.930
<i>He was so good-looking!</i>

13:47.930 --> 13:49.240
<i>It was love at first sight.</i>

13:49.240 --> 13:52.040
<i>I asked him to take me.</i>

13:52.040 --> 13:54.230
<i>That's quite bold.</i>

13:54.230 --> 13:55.990
<i>What did your husband think of that?</i>

13:58.020 --> 14:00.560
<b>Raise Your Value</b>

13:58.020 --> 14:00.560
Upgrade yourself!

13:58.020 --> 14:01.770
Next Trends

13:58.390 --> 14:01.770
I spent all night studying, 
and now I'm all set.

14:02.290 --> 14:04.810
I'm going to make this work.

14:04.810 --> 14:06.530
I'll make her fall for me, and...

14:07.010 --> 14:09.530
Are you going to take me?

14:09.530 --> 14:12.820
<i>Be ready to use those words, Amane Lily!</i>

14:12.820 --> 14:15.080
Morning, Amane!

14:15.120 --> 14:17.290
<b>Hi-ho</b>

14:17.200 --> 14:18.460
Morning.

14:19.920 --> 14:22.170
M-Morning.

14:24.210 --> 14:27.550
<i>He's flustered by my plan!</i>

14:27.840 --> 14:31.450
<i>My plan, indeed, from the TV show yada yada yada!</i>

14:31.300 --> 14:41.940
<b>Lovey-dovey Married Couple</b>

14:31.450 --> 14:34.600
<i>I mean, I was a bit of 
a delinquent at the time.</i>

14:34.600 --> 14:38.600
<i>But I couldn't say no to that, and I was 
head-over-heels for her anyway...</i>

14:38.600 --> 14:41.940
<i>So I figured I'd take 
my life a bit more seriously.</i>

14:41.940 --> 14:43.880
<i>I spent all night studying.</i>

14:43.880 --> 14:45.230
<i>I'm all set!</i>

14:45.230 --> 14:48.240
<i>I did plenty of research on hairstyles.</i>

14:49.350 --> 14:52.700
<i>I shall make him fall in love with me, 
and I will reform him!</i>

14:54.850 --> 14:57.710
I'm not blushing or anything.

14:57.710 --> 14:59.460
My neck just hurts.

14:59.460 --> 15:02.700
<i>Why is he so shiny?!</i>

14:59.580 --> 15:03.460
<b>Whoaaaaaa</b>

15:03.790 --> 15:06.660
<i>How did he become so dazzling?</i>

15:07.160 --> 15:08.060
<i>No...</i>

15:08.060 --> 15:10.560
<i>Why is she so squishy?</i>

15:10.560 --> 15:11.360
<i>Hang on...</i>

15:11.360 --> 15:13.470
<i>Did she watch the TV show last night, too?</i>

15:13.470 --> 15:15.810
<i>And she got the same idea?!</i>

15:13.470 --> 15:15.810
<i>And he got the same idea?!</i>

15:13.470 --> 15:15.810
<b>Got
the
same
idea!!</b>

15:19.380 --> 15:20.970
Do you see something weird?

15:20.970 --> 15:21.810
I do.

15:31.160 --> 15:33.740
And so this value is...

15:33.740 --> 15:36.310
And then factor this, and...

15:39.060 --> 15:40.070
Whoops.

15:44.240 --> 15:45.000
Here.

15:45.000 --> 15:45.670
Thanks.

15:52.070 --> 15:54.950
I touched his hand.

15:57.980 --> 15:58.770
Box!

16:02.890 --> 16:08.400
And so begins the fight of the century 
for the junior one-nyan class throne.

16:02.890 --> 16:08.400
Futakotamagawa

16:08.680 --> 16:11.280
<i>Amane closes in just as the gong goes off.</i>

16:11.280 --> 16:14.730
<i>Akutsu, caught off-guard, 
fends Amane off with a jab!</i>

16:14.730 --> 16:20.230
<i>Alas, Amane saw it coming, 
and hits him with a body blow!</i>

16:21.040 --> 16:24.960
<i>It hits hard! We get a glimpse 
of the mouthguard!</i>

16:27.380 --> 16:28.790
<i>I let my guard down.</i>

16:29.300 --> 16:31.360
<i>She's gotten ahead of me.</i>

16:31.360 --> 16:33.130
<i>I need to retaliate!</i>

16:34.150 --> 16:35.390
<i>It worked.</i>

16:35.390 --> 16:38.630
<i>You're 12,000 years too early 
to try challenging me.</i>

16:41.720 --> 16:43.810
There's something in your hair.

16:45.650 --> 16:48.670
<i>Akutsu is keeling forward!</i>

16:48.670 --> 16:50.810
<i>But without offering a moment's respite,</i>

16:50.810 --> 16:54.410
<i>Amane throws a right hook, 
going for the knockout!</i>

16:54.410 --> 16:55.860
Not so fast!

16:56.520 --> 16:57.950
<i>Body!</i>

16:57.950 --> 17:00.270
<i>Akutsu dodges it in the nick of time!</i>

17:00.270 --> 17:04.250
<i>He returns the favor with a punch to the pit!</i>

17:08.530 --> 17:12.090
<i>How dare you defy an angel!</i>

17:14.010 --> 17:15.130
<i>You'll pay!</i>

17:15.130 --> 17:17.030
<i>You'll pay, Akutsu!</i>

17:17.560 --> 17:22.520
<i>And so the cold war intensified.</i>

17:23.520 --> 17:25.770
I know, it's so funny.

17:25.770 --> 17:27.400
Right, Lily-chan?

17:27.400 --> 17:28.570
Amane.

17:28.570 --> 17:29.400
Yes?

17:29.400 --> 17:31.790
You're on day duty today, aren't you?

17:31.790 --> 17:34.380
Take this to the staff office for me.

17:34.380 --> 17:37.160
Ask a guy to help you out if it's too heavy.

17:37.160 --> 17:38.570
Okay.

17:39.120 --> 17:42.670
<i>Damn it, ungrateful humans...</i>

17:42.670 --> 17:43.580
<i>I know!</i>

17:43.920 --> 17:46.150
Akutsu-kun, Akutsu-kun...

17:47.040 --> 17:50.980
I got asked to take this, but it's so heavy.

17:50.980 --> 17:53.180
Help me?

17:53.130 --> 17:53.800
<b>Squeeze</b>

17:53.180 --> 17:53.800
Squeeze.

17:53.800 --> 17:54.530
Squeeze!

17:54.530 --> 17:57.300
<i>The sleeve tug?!</i>

17:57.300 --> 17:58.480
<i>Look at that!</i>

17:58.480 --> 18:03.130
<i>Amane retaliates relentlessly 
over Akutsu's guard!</i>

18:03.130 --> 18:04.410
<i>The pressure!</i>

18:04.410 --> 18:06.230
<i>Akutsu is slowly getting pushed back!</i>

18:07.320 --> 18:08.350
Left uppercut!

18:08.350 --> 18:09.850
I can hold this!

18:12.800 --> 18:15.450
<i>A quick feigned uppercut!</i>

18:15.450 --> 18:17.780
<i>A straight punch lands right in his face!</i>

18:21.660 --> 18:23.070
Lucky.

18:23.070 --> 18:23.800
Whoa!

18:23.800 --> 18:24.830
What's wrong?

18:25.400 --> 18:27.400
<i>Impressive, Amane.</i>

18:27.400 --> 18:30.620
<i>You go straight for a man's weak point.</i>

18:31.160 --> 18:32.250
<i>I know!</i>

18:32.720 --> 18:34.590
Yeah, I got you.

18:34.590 --> 18:37.680
It's a bit heavy for a girl, huh?

18:37.680 --> 18:39.310
<i>He held firm.</i>

18:45.970 --> 18:48.120
Well, let's go.

18:49.810 --> 18:51.290
Schwing!

18:51.690 --> 18:52.830
<i>Tendons!</i>

18:52.830 --> 18:54.610
<i>And veins!</i>

18:54.610 --> 18:56.560
<i>That's gotta hurt!</i>

18:56.560 --> 19:00.610
<i>Akutsu is losing his balance, 
but the storm of punches isn't over yet!</i>

19:03.200 --> 19:05.450
<i>A short uppercut breaks the guard!</i>

19:08.310 --> 19:09.470
<i>Bam!</i>

19:09.470 --> 19:13.150
<i>Amane also loses balance!</i>

19:13.750 --> 19:15.620
Well, let's go.

19:18.010 --> 19:19.580
<i>Shoot!</i>

19:19.580 --> 19:22.040
<i>I never expected such a response.</i>

19:22.040 --> 19:24.020
<i>I'm rather impressed.</i>

19:24.020 --> 19:24.800
<i>But...</i>

19:24.800 --> 19:28.110
<i>I'll make sure you know it's not so easy.</i>

19:28.110 --> 19:31.300
<i>I will be victorious!</i>

19:32.050 --> 19:33.220
Fluff.

19:33.900 --> 19:35.440
It's so hot.

19:35.440 --> 19:36.320
Is it?

19:36.320 --> 19:37.790
Another hot day...

19:37.790 --> 19:38.820
How shameful!

19:38.820 --> 19:40.200
I'll get that for you.

19:52.160 --> 19:54.420
<i>This is getting nowhere.</i>

19:54.980 --> 19:58.560
<i>But he's barely standing.</i>

19:58.560 --> 20:00.560
<i>It ends now...</i>

20:00.560 --> 20:03.480
<i>With my next blow!</i>

20:04.610 --> 20:07.140
All right, let's have you write 
the answer to this one.

20:07.140 --> 20:09.560
How about Amane, 
who's exhausted for some reason?

20:10.210 --> 20:11.150
Okay.

20:11.560 --> 20:13.480
<i>I'm taking him down with the next blow.</i>

20:13.480 --> 20:14.960
<i>I'm taking him down with the next blow.</i>

20:14.960 --> 20:16.200
<i>I'm taking him down with the next blow.</i>

20:16.200 --> 20:18.720
<i>Take him down, take him down, take him down...</i>

20:18.020 --> 20:20.280
Worshiped 12 Olympian gods, with (1) Zeus
as the king.

20:18.020 --> 20:20.280
A polytheistic faith that believed gods to have human form
and emotions.

20:18.020 --> 20:20.280
(2) Thales

20:18.020 --> 20:20.280
held that (3) water was the basis of all things

20:18.020 --> 20:20.280
Types of Pillars

20:18.020 --> 20:20.280
(4) Doric

20:18.020 --> 20:20.280
(5) Ionic

20:18.020 --> 20:20.280
(6) Corinthian

20:18.020 --> 20:20.280
The temple to Athena,
(7) Parthenon of Athens is a
(8) Doric temple.

20:18.720 --> 20:21.660
<i>with the next, with the next, with the next...</i>

20:20.750 --> 20:22.150
Good. Well done.

20:22.150 --> 20:24.160
<i>I'm taking him down with the next blow.</i>

20:24.920 --> 20:26.840
<i>I'm taking him down with the next blow.</i>

20:27.520 --> 20:29.990
<i>I'm taking him down with the next blow!</i>

20:38.380 --> 20:41.050
<i>Take this! My suicide attack!</i>

20:41.050 --> 20:43.720
<i>You must not have expected that!</i>

20:46.040 --> 20:48.280
<i>Amane's uppercut takes Akutsu by surprise!</i>

20:48.280 --> 20:51.100
<i>His jaw rattles!</i>

20:51.100 --> 20:53.100
Ama—

20:53.480 --> 20:57.950
<i>And now, I look up at him teary-eyed 
and whisper with a sweet voice.</i>

20:57.950 --> 20:59.890
S-Sorry...

20:59.890 --> 21:01.230
<i>Wh-What's this?!</i>

21:01.230 --> 21:04.000
<i>Amane rocks left and right, faster and faster.</i>

21:04.000 --> 21:04.670
<i>Is this it?</i>

21:04.670 --> 21:07.160
<i>Is it the Dempsey Roll?!</i>

21:07.160 --> 21:14.170
The figure eight of Amane's body 
is Heaven's road to a KO!

21:14.660 --> 21:16.410
<i>Victory is mine!</i>

21:16.410 --> 21:18.500
A-Akutsu-kun...

21:19.000 --> 21:20.380
Shoot!

21:21.120 --> 21:23.300
Damn it!

21:32.980 --> 21:36.690
What are you two doing, 
getting flirty during class?

21:42.530 --> 21:44.280
<i>I suppose...</i>

21:44.280 --> 21:45.610
<i>For today...</i>

21:46.020 --> 21:47.980
<i>I'll let you off the hook!</i>

21:49.530 --> 21:52.290
A few days later

21:52.290 --> 21:55.250
Comics
Consoles
Crane catchers
Right at the top
of the elevator

21:52.920 --> 21:54.270
He's late.

21:54.270 --> 21:58.100
Akutsu has some nerve, making me wait.

22:00.340 --> 22:01.920
You're late!

22:01.920 --> 22:04.260
You were supposed to be here five 
minutes before the scheduled time!

22:08.440 --> 22:09.480
What?
